\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Tuning history for the diffuse-prior re-estimation round (reserve-equation fix; $b_\pi ,b_y$ diffuse Gamma priors; $\varphi _b$ prior mean lowered to 0.05). The jscale=0.10 production run's severe diagnostic-to-production degradation (28.0\%/17.5\% $\to $ 5.43\%/5.31\%, roughly 5$\times $, worse than any prior round) motivated both a further jscale cut and, given how badly the usual 3{,}000-draw diagnostic had just mispredicted production behavior, a longer 8{,}000-draw diagnostic before committing to another full run.}}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
