\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Combined determinacy/E-stability region over $(b_\pi ,b_y)\in [0,5]\times [0,3]$, all other parameters at posterior means (current, diffuse-prior round). Green: determinate \emph  {and} E-stable (the two conditions coincide exactly on this grid, with 0/3{,}600 mismatched cells). Red: indeterminate or explosive, and E-unstable. The star marks the posterior mean $(b_\pi ,b_y)=(3.474,0.083)$, now visible within the plotted range.}}{12}{}\protected@file@percent }
